---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <main class="container">
    <section class="page-intro">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>
        I’m building this space to document what I’m learning in cybersecurity through
        writing, hands-on labs, and visual explanations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <article class="card">
      <p>
        Security Sketchbook is part portfolio, part learning archive, and part creative
        notebook. I wanted one place where I could share technical investigations,
        explain concepts in a way that feels intuitive, and show how I think through problems.
      </p>

      <p>
        The site is organized into three sections:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Blog</strong> for reflections and explanatory posts</li>
        <li><strong>Labs</strong> for hands-on technical work</li>
        <li><strong>Sketchbook</strong> for diagrams, analogies, and visual notes</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>